  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "第二十八关（前）"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_wild_a"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's dangerous to lose focus on the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm sorry..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I just... am having trouble understanding..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Reunion has bunkered down inside an abandoned mine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "That woman, W, also fled inside."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can give you some space if you need time alone."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "However, the L.G.D. has no time to waste."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hoshiguma, gather the others."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "(Misha...)"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Madam Ch'en--"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I have one concern."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Concern?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "W is a master of explosives."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "It's highly likely that she has deployed traps on the battlefield."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm worried that... we'd sustain heavy casualties from a direct confrontation."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "My suggestion is for Rhodes Island to sneak into the mine while your forces set up an encirclement."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We'll flush out the Reunion forces, and you can arrest them immediately..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "And those who refuse to surrender, we'll handle our way."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "How confident do you feel about facing that woman?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'm not sure..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...But we can bear that risk."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We've fought her more than once before. At least we have some understanding of her fighting style."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "There are some risks... that the L.G.D. can't afford to shoulder."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We can't afford to lose sight of the mission objective either."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "PC94172, take our forces and surround the mines!"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hoshiguma, pick out a few troops to take with you."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We'll each take a squad and move in with Rhodes Island."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hoshiguma, you and Rhodes Island will split off and pincer them. Destroy their base of operations, and rout their defenses."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll take care of the firebases."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "For Lungmen's sake, we have to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...bring Misha back."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "...Understood."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll gather our operators."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ch'en, there's a small group of Reunion forces heading out along the edge of the mines."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They're moving pretty quickly, too."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'll head out first, otherwise we might lose them."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Hurry. Don't let them get away."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Ah, Madam Hoshiguma, please wait a moment."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "When they ambushed us earlier, they were hiding some casters among their forces."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I'd recommend taking two of our operators, Franka and Liskarm, with your squad."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "They have a lot of experience fighting casters."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "No problem."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Franka",
      "speakerId": "char_106_franka",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "All right, let's do this, shall we?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "What about you, Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Liskarm",
      "speakerId": "char_107_liskam",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr. Kal'tsit told us to..."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Penguin Logistics is backing me up, so I'll be fine."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Hoshiguma",
      "speakerId": "char_136_hsguma",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Sounds like a plan."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I can't stress this enough, but don't be too stubborn. Back off if the situation gets too rough."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Ch'en",
      "speakerId": "char_010_chen",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Amiya?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "I know."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "We don't have much time left."
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "Amiya",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "This isn't like Chernobog... This time, it's our turn to stop Reunion!"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
